WEBVTT

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.620
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.180
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed, do they want to protect themselves or other people.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.830
Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.770
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.430
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:19.480
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:24.700
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.960
Introducing a new transfer student.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:33.080
I’m Inuo Atsushi. Pleased to meet you.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.300
Washizu, you’re responsible for him.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:35.840
Yes!

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.350
Look after him, since there’s a lot he doesn’t know.

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:40.680
Yes!

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.420
Nice to meet you!

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.910
Yeah, nice to meet you, too!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:50.930
Liar

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:20.930
Yuurisan-Subs & マイワイフ Subs

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:20.930
http://yuurisan-subs.org
http://maiwaifufansubs.wordpress.com

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:20.930
Sub Dedicated to Enma Ai

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:26.650
This program is made possible by Sony Music,

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:30.030
and the listed sponsors.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.310
Hey, look look!

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:41.510
Inuo!

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:42.560
Got it!

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:45.720
How cool!

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.630
That the new student from A-Class, right?

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.970
Inuo Atsushi-kun.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:54.000
Yeah, Inuo-kun. Wait, why do you know?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.720
Of course she would know; everyone’s 
got their eyes on him.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.250
Oh, really?

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.250
He came from Tokyo!

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.640
Exactly! He’s a bit different from the other guys from this city, isn’t he?

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.890
Mm… The metropolitan smell!

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:10.220
Still, transferring at this time of third year.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:16.230
His mother’s ill, apparently, and is
staying at her home, in this city.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:18.000
How about his father?

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.400
Working in Tokyo, apparently.

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:25.250
Inuo-kun’s taking care of his mother by himself.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.530
That’s a lot of work.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.250
That guy…

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:35.290
Go get him, Inuo!

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.270
Goodbye!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.680
Goodbye!

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:40.620
Goodbye!

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:41.460
Goodbye!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.290
Goodbye!

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:43.950
Goodbye!

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:46.520
Goodbye!

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.000
Goodbye!

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.860
Goodbye!

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:50.810
Goodbye!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.140
Wanna stop by at the arcade?

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.460
Yeah, I’ll go!

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.500
Sorry, but I’ll pass.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.010
Ah, right.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.020
My bad.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:11.280
It’s fine. Well, see you tomorrow!

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.480
I heard they remodeled!

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:32.820
How nice! We’d like to, too!

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.070
Good evening!

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:35.850
Good evening.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.010
How responsible.

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:41.740
Every day! I’m impressed!

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:52.430
I’m home.

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:57.560
Well, if you click on the PC.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.700
The girl that comes to your room.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:03.750
Oh, that one that comes at one after you click at midnight?

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.510
No, that’s Jigoku Shoujo.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:09.050
Or that one that’s like "I’m here!" in bad Japanese?

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:09.680
Those are returnees!

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.010
Welcome back.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.000
You’re late.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:16.460
Let’s go to that place… you know, in Yokohama…

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:16.460
Have you talked to grandpa about the rent?

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.600
Yeah, he said he’ll wire it tomorrow.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:26.610
Lecturing 24/7 to his daughter, yet like this when his grandson begs.

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:33.270
<i>A lie?</i>

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.050
Yup, a lie.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:39.800
Let’s make it so I’m sick, and you’re taking care of me.

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:41.820
Why something like that?

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:45.810
The country’s scarier than the city, you know.

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:50.830
What’ll they say if they knew we returned because my husband vanished?

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:54.330
That’s impossible! We could never
 carry out a lie like that!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.890
What would I say if they asked about dad?

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.040
I don’t care, just do what I say!

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:03.080
Wasn’t Jigoku Shoujo at your house?
That monster-like thing.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:05.010
That’s our household god.

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:07.290
So stupid!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:09.980
Hey, what’s your dad doing?

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:14.210
He owns a few restaurants, so he can’t take weekends off.

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:16.310
So he doesn’t come over here?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:20.800
Sometimes, on weeknights. He’s gone in the morning, though.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.120
Here, eat this.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:25.840
How serious! How’s your mother’s health?

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:28.800
If there’s anything you need, say it.

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:32.880
Yes, thank you very much!

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.940
Send

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.940
Your grudge shall be released.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:58.770
Um…

00:06:58.770 --> 00:06:59.420
Hmm?

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.270
Hey, welcome!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.800
Welcome!

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:09.040
Vegetables are cheaper here, so…

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.550
You’re right, thanks!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.880
Oh, I’m sorry.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.520
What are you sorry about?

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:25.080
I always say you at the supermarket, and was wondering whether to tell you…

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:27.400
Oh, that’s fine.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.140
Uh… Mikage-san, right?

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:32.010
Do you come shopping a lot?

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:36.050
Yes, since I live alone.

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:36.750
What?

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:41.010
My father’s working, and my mother’s with him.

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:41.920
So…

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:46.090
Oh, how lucky.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:47.090
What?

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.830
Did I… interrupt?

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:59.990
It’s not like that. I mean, what were you doing?

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:03.530
What? Oh, I had some shopping to do, so…

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:04.710
At the vegetable store?

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.000
Well, uh…

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:13.310
Since you’ve been kind of down, Inuo.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:21.180
I know it’s tiring working for your mother, but mood changes are important…

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:27.160
Maybe we should play near your place? Planning ahead to not go too late.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.220
Sorry.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:34.720
A lie?

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.790
What do you mean?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.940
Why do you have to tell a lie like that?

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:44.690
That’s messed up!

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:47.150
I know. But…

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:48.910
Let’s discuss with our teacher.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:53.450
That wouldn’t work.

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:58.370
Why? I know everyone will forgive
 you even if they know!

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:04.320
You were just following orders, right?
It’s all your mother’s fault, after all.

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:10.290
That’s horrible, just for her own pride, making you lie.

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:12.710
That’s the worst! I can’t believe it!

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:16.520
Sorry, forget what I said.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:17.790
Forget? What do you mean?

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:19.160
Later.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:22.260
Hey! Wait! Inuo!

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:33.580
What’ve you been doing until now?! You’re
looking after me! What if they doubt us?!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:37.110
I was with a friend, and…

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:41.570
Friend?! You haven’t told him, have you?

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.630
You told him?

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:53.470
What were you doing? Are you trying
 to disgrace me? Eh?

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:58.780
Don’t you know what would happen if you did that? Use your brains!

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.500
You… you… you!

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:18.810
Even you, even you’re betraying me? Like that man…

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:25.060
I’ve only got you, so don’t leave me!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:31.570
Don’t leave me alone! Atsushi! Atsushi!

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.080
Send

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.080
Your grudge shall be released.

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:38.430
Send

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:39.420
Send

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:43.380
I’m here.

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:45.940
Jigoku… Shoujo?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:47.910
Bone Lady.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.790
Got it, Ojou.

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.230
Take this.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:05.250
If you really want to release your
 hate. Just pull the red string.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:13.540
If you do, it would mean you formally signed a contract. The person would be swiftly sent to Hell.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:19.010
If you do, I need you to pay the price.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:27.030
Curse someone, and two holes appear.
Agree, and your soul will fall to Hell.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.700
Hell?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.210
Well, that’s after you die.

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:34.870
The rest is up to you.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:02.470
Here, Hime.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:06.730
There’re no signs of pulling the string.

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:10.920
It’s fine that he typed the name in, but nothing since then.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:13.500
He seems to have the straw doll with him.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.510
Hmm?

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.660
Is it true?

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:26.660
Yesterday, too! My mother was in the same high school, so there’s no mistake!

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:30.500
Inuo-kun’s mother, with a man, did…

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:39.680
Eating snacks and drinking.

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:41.680
What happened to the husband?

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:45.970
Actually, she got dumped, so she escaped over here!

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.580
Well, see you later!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.410
See you later!

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:55.930
Wait, mom!

00:12:55.930 --> 00:13:01.010
How annoying! Just because I’m sick, doesn’t mean I have to stay home all day.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:04.610
But… if you walk around too much…

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:17.000
She said she’s going to a friend’s. She knows Chinese medicine, apparently, so…

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.000
Have you been told to say that?

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:23.980
I thought of telling our teacher.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:29.460
But I thought it would be bad to tell without asking.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:37.470
If not our teacher, it can be anyone… A relative… Don’t you have someone?

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:44.420
Anyway, it can’t stay like this! If you stay with that mother, you’ll…

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:48.510
Go home! Just leave me alone!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.590
Why? Are you trying to cover for your mother?

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:56.370
I know you don’t want to talk to others about how bad your mother is, but!

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.030
A straw doll?

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.520
What is that?

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:06.650
I’ve heard about this… Jigoku Shoujo?

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.250
Of course not, right? It’s just a rumor…

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:19.460
Wait, where’s your mother?

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:26.140
What am I thinking? Let’s stop thinking
 about such stupid things!

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:32.400
Right? We just have to talk. Why should you be sacrificed for such a mother?

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:35.900
I mean, you have some fault too.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:41.640
Since you listened to her and lied.
If I were you, I wouldn’t have.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:49.610
Anyway, don’t think so gravely;
I can support you, right?

00:14:54.520 --> 00:15:01.710
That straw doll… I heard rumors that the curser is also sent to Hell.

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:05.370
I have to do something for him… something…

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:23.580
Really?

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.470
Yes, with a man.

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:26.470
Really?

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:29.160
They said there was quite a big fuss.

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:52.540
What’s up, bringing me to such a place?

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.070
Look.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:04.650
Stop, in a place like this.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:10.160
I’ve heard stories. Are they true?

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.680
That story? What story?

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.950
That you have a kid.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.640
What? Where’d you hear that?

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:20.050
I don’t know, somewhere.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:26.680
There’s no kid, what are you saying? It’s impossible!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:27.900
But…

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.620
You can’t believe me?

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:33.090
Come on, come on.

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:37.170
Come on, let’s go to the next one!

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:40.200
Got it? She’s that kind of person.

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:58.040
Inuo!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:08.230
You still don’t get it? If the rumors are true, you’re going to Hell, too!

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:11.690
Why would you sacrifice yourself for a mother like her?

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:15.930
If we talked to our teacher tomorrow, everyone would understand!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.200
Your grudge… is released.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:19.000
Wh-What is this?

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.650
Are you OK?

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.520
Help me! Help me!

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:42.050
Help’s coming!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:44.490
Just be a bit patient!

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.590
Don’t give up!

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:48.070
Hang in there!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:52.050
I can’t! Quick! Quick!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:58.380
Why… Why do I have to suffer?

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:01.930
Aren’t you the root of all his problems?

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.570
Why did you come to a place like this?

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:07.860
He doesn’t have any planning skills.

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:10.370
He doesn’t understand human feelings.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.820
Nonesense!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.680
What are you saying?

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:17.330
Always doing it his own way.

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.870
Only looking after for himself.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.330
Your world view is small.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:22.410
Don’t mind!

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:26.640
What a dirty situation!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:28.960
How lame, that sense.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:29.870
Only looking for praise.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:30.470
Nonesense!

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:33.220
There are some things he doesn’t want others to notice.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:34.520
Conceited.

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:35.540
Don’t mind!

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:36.630
You probably don’t know.

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:37.190
Nonesense!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.640
How callous!

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:40.150
Unskilled, too.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:45.560
Rude, all bark, with no social skills.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.190
But...

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:49.960
We’ll support you.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.160
Yes.

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:53.450
Go, go, you’re hanging on!

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:56.330
Go, go, you’re hanging on! Yay!

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.470
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:03.280
Acting all nice, aren’t you just enjoying my pain?

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:05.090
Be quiet! Be quiet!

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:14.090
I’m in luck.

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:30.760
O pitiful shadow, wandering in darkness.

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:33.700
Scarring others and looking them down.

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:36.090
The ball of karma is drowned in sin.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:42.660
Want to try dying this once?

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:59.310
Why? Why? I was doing it for him!

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:02.800
Because he was so bad! But…

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:05.850
I… I!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:09.460
Mother!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:13.890
This grudge will send you to Hell.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.270
Good morning!

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:22.370
Washizu-kun from A-Class is missing.

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.040
He didn’t come home after yesterday.

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:27.840
They said his relatives told the police.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.120
I wonder if he ran away?

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:36.450
Hey!

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:46.540
Oh, this? My dad’s coming today, so I thought I would be extravagant for once.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:47.530
What?

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:49.070
Well, later!

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:01.070
What is this? Nothing to take!

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:06.090
I told you to get it cleaned! What an unhelpful child!

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:11.600
Got it, mom. Dad’s opening a new store, right?

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:15.610
Daikanyama, I think. He’s probably going to be busy again.

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:16.910
Atsushi!

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:26.200
I quit! Let’s eat out tonight with dad, right, mom?

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:29.190
A-Atsushi.

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:36.500
How rare, to eat together! I wonder what would be nice?

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:42.420
Right, he liked sushi. I wonder if there’s a good place?

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:49.950
